      "text": "其实还可以再有"
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "start": 627.27,
      "end": 628.23,
      "text": "但是"
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "start": 628.23,
      "end": 629.51,
      "text": "那两个小时工作是我的"
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "start": 629.51,
      "end": 630.15,
      "text": "来系统了"
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "start": 630.15,
      "end": 631.19,
      "text": "我不想把它再有化了"
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "start": 631.19,
      "end": 632.07,
      "text": "我就全都还没意思"
    },
    {
      "index": 296,
      "start": 632.07,
      "end": 633.51,
      "text": "就我还是需要"
    },
    {
      "index": 297,
      "start": 633.51,
      "end": 635.43,
      "text": "自我去去体会他"
    },
    {
      "index": 298,
      "start": 635.43,
      "end": 636.71,
      "text": "我就能去消费了"
    },
    {
      "index": 299,
      "start": 638.07,
      "end": 638.87,
      "text": "你看"
    },
    {
      "index": 300,
      "start": 638.87,
      "end": 640.47,
      "text": "这就是我作为一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 301,
      "start": 640.47,
      "end": 641.59,
      "text": "公司的"
    },
    {
      "index": 302,
      "start": 641.59,
      "end": 643.35,
      "text": "整个的一个过程"
    },
    {
      "index": 303,
      "start": 643.67,
      "end": 645.11,
      "text": "似不过我在总结里"
    },
    {
      "index": 304,
      "start": 646.07,
      "end": 646.87,
      "text": "首先第一个"
    },
    {
      "index": 305,
      "start": 647.67,
      "end": 649.19,
      "text": "你的口袋里应该就有你想要的"
    },
    {
      "index": 306,
      "start": 649.19,
      "end": 651.67,
      "text": "如果你口袋里没用你想要的"
    },
    {
      "index": 307,
      "start": 651.67,
      "end": 652.71,
      "text": "你一定是拿出来的问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 308,
      "start": 652.71,
      "end": 653.91,
      "text": "一定要反思总结一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 309,
      "start": 653.91,
      "end": 655.91,
      "text": "所以你必须给自己设议过"
    },
    {
      "index": 310,
      "start": 655.91,
      "end": 656.55,
      "text": "时间避"
    },
    {
      "index": 311,
      "start": 657.35,
      "end": 658.39,
      "text": "周期性的"
    },
    {
      "index": 312,
      "start": 658.39,
      "end": 659.91,
      "text": "每过一段时候反思总结一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 313,
      "start": 660.63,
      "end": 661.99,
      "text": "没有东西的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 314,
      "start": 661.99,
      "end": 663.19,
      "text": "没有拿到东西的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 315,
      "start": 663.19,
      "end": 665.43,
      "text": "一定不是因为你不过努力"
    },
    {
      "index": 316,
      "start": 665.43,
      "end": 666.95,
      "text": "肯定是在塞造出问题了"
    },
    {
      "index": 317,
      "start": 666.95,
      "end": 667.75,
      "text": "你好好想想"
    },
    {
      "index": 318,
      "start": 667.75,
      "end": 668.39,
      "text": "这是第一个问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 319,
      "start": 668.39,
      "end": 669.75,
      "text": "一定要有反思不断的时间"
    },
    {
      "index": 320,
      "start": 670.39,
      "end": 671.35,
      "text": "第二个部分"
    },
    {
      "index": 321,
      "start": 671.51,
      "end": 673.11,
      "text": "学习的目的是"
    },
    {
      "index": 322,
      "start": 673.75,
      "end": 675.43,
      "text": "能够床造"
    },
    {
      "index": 323,
      "start": 675.43,
      "end": 676.47,
      "text": "能够生产东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 324,
      "start": 676.47,
      "end": 678.07,
      "text": "而不是为了需要很多知识"
    },
    {
      "index": 325,
      "start": 678.95,
      "end": 680.63,
      "text": "有很多知识无法运行的"
    },
    {
      "index": 326,
      "start": 680.63,
      "end": 681.83,
      "text": "比如说你搜射墙墙的东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 327,
      "start": 681.83,
      "end": 682.87,
      "text": "看了视频点赞"
    },
    {
      "index": 328,
      "start": 682.87,
      "end": 683.99,
      "text": "看见这个东西点赞"
    },
    {
      "index": 329,
      "start": 683.99,
      "end": 685.27,
      "text": "这个把它打收场"
    },
    {
      "index": 330,
      "start": 685.27,
      "end": 686.95,
      "text": "那个都是不能运行的东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 331,
      "start": 686.95,
      "end": 688.07,
      "text": "上一个客气的利益"
    },
    {
      "index": 332,
      "start": 688.07,
      "end": 689.03,
      "text": "那都是不能运行的"
    },
    {
      "index": 333,
      "start": 689.59,
      "end": 690.95,
      "text": "真正进行的东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 334,
      "start": 690.95,
      "end": 692.15,
      "text": "一定能够才能夹势"
    },
    {
      "index": 335,
      "start": 692.15,
      "end": 693.83,
      "text": "所以我用寒书这个词"
    },
    {
      "index": 336,
      "start": 694.23,
      "end": 695.03,
      "text": "对"
    },
    {
      "index": 337,
      "start": 695.19,
      "end": 696.15,
      "text": "好好想一想"
    },
    {
      "index": 338,
      "start": 696.15,
      "end": 697.59,
      "text": "你都有哪些亲人"
    },
    {
      "index": 339,
      "start": 697.59,
      "end": 698.47,
      "text": "书什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 340,
      "start": 698.47,
      "end": 699.27,
      "text": "说的过程什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 341,
      "start": 699.27,
      "end": 699.75,
      "text": "书什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 342,
      "start": 699.75,
      "end": 701.11,
      "text": "谁问你的书说买单"
    },
    {
      "index": 343,
      "start": 701.75,
      "end": 702.55,
      "text": "多长时间没什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 344,
      "start": 702.55,
      "end": 703.23,
      "text": "一定要听说"
    },
    {
      "index": 345,
      "start": 703.23,
      "end": 704.63,
      "text": "烈了完了以后你就知道"
    },
    {
      "index": 346,
      "start": 704.63,
      "end": 706.79,
      "text": "为什么你是现在的你了"
    },
    {
      "index": 347,
      "start": 708.15,
      "end": 709.27,
      "text": "这个技能从哪来"
    },
    {
      "index": 348,
      "start": 710.15,
      "end": 712.39,
      "text": "一个是总结自己过去成功的经验"
    },
    {
      "index": 349,
      "start": 713.75,
      "end": 715.51,
      "text": "一个是细去别人成的经验"
    },
    {
      "index": 350,
      "start": 715.51,
      "end": 716.71,
      "text": "AI能防疫"
    },
    {
      "index": 351,
      "start": 716.71,
      "end": 717.83,
      "text": "跟来讲"
    },
    {
      "index": 352,
      "start": 717.83,
      "end": 718.71,
      "text": "你过去做一些什么事"
    },
    {
      "index": 353,
      "start": 718.71,
      "end": 719.27,
      "text": "怎么做的"
    },
    {
      "index": 354,
      "start": 719.27,
      "end": 720.23,
      "text": "怎么成功呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 355,
      "start": 720.23,
      "end": 721.03,
      "text": "让他把你总结"
    },
    {
      "index": 356,
      "start": 721.03,
      "end": 721.91,
      "text": "撑进来的扶用"
    },
    {
      "index": 357,
      "start": 722.95,
      "end": 723.67,
      "text": "学习的东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 358,
      "start": 723.67,
      "end": 724.23,
      "text": "把你交给"
    },
    {
      "index": 359,
      "start": 724.23,
      "end": 725.19,
      "text": "让他去动用"
    },
    {
      "index": 360,
      "start": 725.75,
      "end": 726.15,
      "text": "好的"
    },
    {
      "index": 361,
      "start": 727.27,
      "end": 728.15,
      "text": "别散个部分"
    },
    {
      "index": 362,
      "start": 728.63,
      "end": 729.83,
      "text": "你的收入等于"
    },
    {
      "index": 363,
      "start": 731.89,
      "end": 733.09,
      "text": "寒书的治疗"
    },
    {
      "index": 364,
      "start": 733.09,
      "end": 733.89,
      "text": "成为月"
    },
    {
      "index": 365,
      "start": 734.93,
      "end": 735.89,
      "text": "掉为我的偏层"
    },
    {
      "index": 366,
      "start": 737.17,
      "end": 737.49,
      "text": "对"
    },
    {
      "index": 367,
      "start": 737.49,
      "end": 738.93,
      "text": "所以应该要把你现在做的事情"
    },
    {
      "index": 368,
      "start": 738.93,
      "end": 739.73,
      "text": "都灭灭灭"
    },
    {
      "index": 369,
      "start": 739.73,
      "end": 740.77,
      "text": "灭来看看哪个问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 370,
      "start": 741.33,
      "end": 742.85,
      "text": "该提升屁肢的提升屁肢"
    },
    {
      "index": 371,
      "start": 742.85,
      "end": 743.81,
      "text": "该降低屁肢"
    },
    {
      "index": 372,
      "start": 743.81,
      "end": 744.29,
      "text": "降低屁肢"
    },
    {
      "index": 373,
      "start": 744.29,
      "end": 745.25,
      "text": "该闪到的分调"
    },
    {
      "index": 374,
      "start": 745.65,
      "end": 747.73,
      "text": "该升于寒书的生产"
    },
    {
      "index": 375,
      "start": 747.73,
      "end": 748.29,
      "text": "几能够"
    },
    {
      "index": 376,
      "start": 748.29,
      "end": 749.33,
      "text": "该升屁"
    },
    {
      "index": 377,
      "start": 749.73,
      "end": 750.37,
      "text": "我之前说了"
    },
    {
      "index": 378,
      "start": 750.37,
      "end": 751.81,
      "text": "我们很久就最大的问题是什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 379,
      "start": 752.29,
      "end": 752.77,
      "text": "主要"
    },
    {
      "index": 380,
      "start": 752.77,
      "end": 753.81,
      "text": "是说年前"
    },
    {
      "index": 381,
      "start": 753.81,
      "end": 754.61,
      "text": "掌握的一个技能"
    },
    {
      "index": 382,
      "start": 754.61,
      "end": 755.89,
      "text": "到现在未知都没有升屁股"
    },
    {
      "index": 383,
      "start": 757.25,
      "end": 757.89,
      "text": "这四个部分"
    },
    {
      "index": 384,
      "start": 758.77,
      "end": 759.73,
      "text": "定期"
    },
    {
      "index": 385,
      "start": 759.73,
      "end": 763.8,
      "text": "删出一些没用的技能"
    },
    {
      "index": 386,
      "start": 765.16,
      "end": 766.84,
      "text": "然后升降的那个"
    },
    {
      "index": 387,
      "start": 766.84,
      "end": 768.44,
      "text": "有用的基督发挥到几层"
    },
    {
      "index": 388,
      "start": 769.16,
      "end": 770.52,
      "text": "就像忙碌说的就"
    },
    {
      "index": 389,
      "start": 771.48,
      "end": 772.6,
      "text": "只喝的方法很简单"
    },
    {
      "index": 390,
      "start": 772.84,
      "end": 774.76,
      "text": "就是你发现什么是有用的"
    },
    {
      "index": 391,
      "start": 775.16,
      "end": 775.88,
      "text": "不断掉我的"
    },
    {
      "index": 392,
      "start": 776.44,
      "end": 777.64,
      "text": "什么是没用的"
    },
    {
      "index": 393,
      "start": 778.04,
      "end": 779.16,
      "text": "以后就不要再用了"
    }
  ]
}